    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your avian organs allow you to retain and repeat audial information quite readily. You become trained in Deception or gain the Assurance skill feat with Deception if you were already trained. You can accurately recall a sound or voice you have heard in the last week, and have a +2 circumstance bonus to all Deception and Performance checks that involve repeating or imitating the sound.</span></p>"
